                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Form Suggested for the Certificate to be Signed by the
                        Company Commander of the Soldier Contemplating Marriage</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#right">_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ France _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ 19 _ _ _</p>
                <p>I,_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (Rank) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (Name) _
                    _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (Organization) do hereby certify that I am one of the
                    superior officers of _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (Name) and that I believe the
                    statements in his foregoing affidavit to be true.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">(Signed) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _</p>
                <p rendition="#right">(Rank and organization) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _</p>
            </div>
